{
  "description": "Evaluation questions for the Core5 Academy help knowledge base. For each question: the role asking, the intent, the document that must answer it, phrases that document must contain (case-insensitive), and phrases that must not appear in the answer source. Checked by validate-kb.js (document sufficiency + a lexical retrieval proxy). This does NOT test the live chatbot.",
